# inkawasi.es goes through this Netlify project (example-gateway) so that visitors on Spanish ISPs
# can still reach it while the court-ordered LaLiga blocks cut Cloudflare's shared IPs during
# football matches (docs/deployment.md). Netlify fetches every request from Cloudflare
# Pages behind the scenes; its servers are not behind a Spanish ISP, so the block does not reach them.
#
# The origin is origin.example.com, a second custom domain of the same Pages project, and not
# example-project.pages.dev: public/_headers marks *.pages.dev with X-Robots-Tag: noindex, and Netlify
# cannot drop an upstream header (its custom headers never apply to proxied content).
#
# Deploy this folder by hand (Netlify → example-gateway → Deploys → drag and drop the folder).
# Each production deploy costs 15 of the team's 300 monthly credits, so change it rarely.

